Subject: [Krypton] Use the Krypton internal scheme, product mark and honest services text

The user requested Krypton branding on visible surfaces. Retain upstream
identifiers and saved preference keys while exposing krypton:// internal
pages and the existing Krypton product artwork. The separate build-time pass
uses upstream GRIT fingerprint helpers to rename user-visible strings after
translations. Services text states that no service instance is operated by
Krypton and that the default addresses are disabled. This changes presentation
and internal navigation only; website-visible identity and service consent
decisions are unchanged.

